# The Witch III shelf: every one of its twenty toys plays, a band of them with both conductors
# sounds sane, and the shelf's third page lists them.
wait 100
seat 0 heart 1234
seat 1 bodybass 77
seat 2 afterhours 5
seat 3 hexbell 9
seat 4 storm 3
seat 5 toll 8
seat 6 fog 1
seat 7 dubout 2
expect seated 8
wav witch3.wav
tap PLAY
wait 16000
expect playing 1
expect notes >80
expect peak_db_min -30
expect peak_db_max 0
wavstop
tap PLAY
wait 100
# the other twelve, as a second band
seat 0 chopbreak 11
seat 1 coldwave 12
seat 2 vespers 13
seat 3 cartridge 14
seat 4 murder 15
seat 5 scrap 16
seat 6 rattle 17
seat 7 phonk 18
tap PLAY
wait 8000
expect notes >200
tap PLAY
wait 100
seat 0 drip 21
seat 1 graveyard 22
seat 2 shiver 23
seat 3 helium 24
tap PLAY
wait 8000
expect notes >300
tap PLAY
wait 100
# the shelf's third page
tap HOME
wait 50
tap OCT+
tap OCT+
wait 50
expect browse 1
shot shelf3.png
tapkey w0
wait 50
tapkey w0
wait 50
expect toy 40
